description: |
  The :tmt:story:`/stories/features/feeling-safe` is no longer working
  as a all-or-nothing switch, it now allows enabling unsafe behavior
  in a granular manner.

  Users of :tmt:story:`/stories/features/feeling-safe` need to account
  for the following changes:

  * ``--feeling-safe`` command-line option now requires a value.
  * ``TMT_FEELING_SAFE=0|1`` values are still supported, as aliases for
    ``TMT_FEELING_SAFE=none|all``.
  * step-level ``--feeling-safe`` option is no longer supported.
